# DACore SMS (on demand)

If this task sends SMS, implements a gateway, or picks an SMS sender: **read** `AIRULES/39-DACORE-SMS.md` and `AIRULES/examples/EX-D07-dacore-sms.md` before writing code.

Do not invent a second SMS stack. Call `DotApp::call("DACore:Sms@…!")` (class `Sms`, not `SMS`). `Parts\Sms` / `SmsProvider` only if they declined DACore drivers.
